      "<figure class=\"madas-excerpt\"><img src=\"resources/madas/alevel-pure-x/q9-solution-2.svg\" alt=\"The expansions are 1 + 2x + 4x2 + · · · and 1 2 −1 4x + 1 8x2 + · · ·. [M1] [A1] The linear terms give 2a/5 −2a/5 = 0 . [M1] [A1] (b) The quadratic terms give 4a/5 + a/5 = a. [B1] Hence a = 10 . [M1] [A1]\" style=\"--madas-width:648.0px\"></figure>",
